{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The test leads and heat shrink fit the practical work suggested by my breadboards, battery holder, relay and PCB kit: making temporary connections, testing circuits and insulating finished wiring.",
    "The smaller caliper fits my need to measure components and mounting dimensions for DIY projects; its size feels more relevant than the larger alternative."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Fast-blinking RGB LEDs are electronics components, but their automatic effects do not serve the simple status-indicator purpose I would usually need.",
    "The milling cutters and vacuum pump require specific projects I have not indicated. Owning a surface thermometer does not mean I am servicing air conditioners."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My electronics purchases seem to have been taken as interest in any LED, even though function, size and color determine whether I can use it.",
    "My general DIY tools seem to have been taken as interest in specialized workshop and HVAC equipment without a matching task."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My existing PCB kit already included LEDs, so more LEDs are less immediately useful than supplies that help connect and finish those projects.",
    "I would choose one heat shrink assortment and one suitable caliper. Finding both alternatives relevant does not mean I need both now.",
    "My latest purchase was caster wheels, which suggests a possible furniture or mobility project; the older electronics purchases alone do not establish what I am working on now."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions understood my practical DIY electronics interests, but sometimes confused related equipment with something I currently need."
}"}
